Cell["\<\
A random connection of the displacement bundle of the grid at scale 2, and \
its holonomy around a square: a cyclic permutation of the six directions at 6.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"0d24431b-f24c-4758-81d3-7e02e4b84263"],

